# Search validation corpus v1.
#
# This is a small project-curated, CC0-1.0 corpus used to validate candidate
# search profiles. It is intentionally versioned in-repository and is not an
# Elo suite. Each non-comment line is:
# id|category|full FEN|allowed bestmoves|score class|depth|source|license
#
# `*` in the allowed-bestmoves column means any legal move is accepted while
# the score class and candidate-vs-baseline safety checks still apply.
